# English strings for the housekeeping half of the app: the engine supervisor
# (Aria2Manager), the log file settings and the history page's batch selection.
#
# Format is "中文 => English"; a [Context] prefix restricts an entry to one Qt
# context (see tools/make-translations.ps1).

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 引擎 / engine
aria2 引擎意外退出（退出码 %1）。 => The aria2 engine exited unexpectedly (code %1).
aria2 引擎已退出，正在自动重启… => The aria2 engine stopped; restarting it…
aria2 引擎已重新启动，下载可以继续了。 => The aria2 engine is running again; downloads can continue.
aria2 引擎连续 %1 次启动失败，已停止自动重启。请在「设置 → RPC / 引擎」里检查引擎路径与参数。 => The aria2 engine failed to start %1 times in a row, so automatic restarting has stopped. Check the engine path and arguments under Settings → RPC / Engine.
引擎已重启，已恢复 %1 个未完成的下载。 => The engine is running again and %1 unfinished download(s) were handed back to it.
引擎尚未就绪，已排队 %1 个任务，连接后自动开始。 => The engine is not ready yet; %1 task(s) are queued and will start as soon as it is.

# ------------------------------------------------------------- 日志 / logging
日志 => Logs
程序运行日志写入下方的目录；引擎输出、崩溃报告都在里面。 => Fetchora writes its log files to the folder below: engine output, warnings and crash reports all end up there.
日志保留天数 => Days of logs to keep
超过这个天数的日志会被自动删除；单个文件超过 4 MB 也会自动切分 => Older files are deleted automatically; a file that grows past 4 MB is split, so a week of logs stays a few megabytes
打开日志目录 => Open the log folder
无法打开日志目录 %1 => Could not open the log folder %1
天 => days

# ------------------------------------------------------- 导航与搜索 / navigation + search
下载任务 => Downloads
搜索下载任务 => Search downloads
在下载任务里按文件名或链接搜索；历史与设置页各有自己的搜索框 => Search the download list by file name or link. The history and settings pages have their own search boxes.

# --------------------------------------------------- 断点续传 / resume behaviour
下载前删除续传文件 => Delete the resume data before downloading
每次开始下载都丢掉 .aria2 续传记录：暂停、继续与断点续传都会失效 => Throw away the .aria2 resume record at the start of every download: pausing, resuming and continuing an interrupted transfer all stop working

# --------------------------------------------------------- 批量选择 / batch selection
批量选择 => Select
退出批量选择 => Done selecting
退出批量选择模式 => Leave batch selection mode
勾选多条记录后一起删除 => Tick several entries and delete them together
已选择 %1 条 => %1 selected
全选 => Select all
取消全选 => Clear selection
全选或取消全选当前列表 => Select or clear every entry in the list
删除选中 => Delete selected
删除选中 (%1) => Delete selected (%1)
取消 => Cancel
删除选中的历史记录 => Delete the selected history entries
将从历史记录中删除选中的 %1 条记录。已经下载的文件不会被删除，此操作无法撤销。 => This removes %1 selected entries from the history. Files that were already downloaded are not touched, and it cannot be undone.
已删除 %1 条历史记录 => Deleted %1 history entries
没有可删除的记录 => There was nothing to delete
